# Binary art is committed directly rather than through Git LFS. The whole payload is
# around 10 MB with no single file over 3 MB, so LFS would add a required client-side
# dependency for no benefit. Revisit if the art budget grows toward its 25 MB ceiling.
*.gltf text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
